        <mxCell id="email_core" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#38BDF8;&quot;&gt;sendEmail() Core Dispatch Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8;&quot;&gt;Cloudflare API Gateway vs Dev Sandbox Simulator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:10px;color:#CBD5E1;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;• Checks CLOUDFLARE_EMAIL_TOKEN / CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID&lt;br&gt;• Production: POST to Cloudflare Email API / REST Gateway&lt;br&gt;• Development: Zero-crash console simulator with plain-text dump&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#38BDF8;fontColor=#FFFFFF;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lane4">
